<%- include('partials/header') %>

    <section class="page-header">
        <div class="container text-center">
            <h1 class="page-title fade-up">Our Heritage</h1>
            <div class="breadcrumbs fade-up delay-1">
                <a href="/">Home</a> <span>/</span> Heritage
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="heritage-story section-padding">
        <div class="container section-grid align-items-center">
            <div class="section-image image-placeholder">
                <div class="img-inner bg-heritage"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="section-text">
                <span class="accent-text">A Legacy of Six Generations</span>
                <h2 class="section-heading">Unbroken Tradition</h2>
                <p>Tajmahal Products is a heritage-driven manufacturer and exporter of luxury handmade carpets from
                    India, carrying forward an unbroken tradition of fine carpet weaving across six generations.</p>
                <p>Established on the principles of craftsmanship, discretion, and consistency, the company serves
                    discerning international clients who value authenticity, refinement, and enduring quality.</p>
                <p>Rooted in artisanal mastery and guided by contemporary aesthetics, Tajmahal Products creates carpets
                    that are both culturally rich and globally relevant.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legacy-tribute section-padding bg-dark text-light text-center">
        <div class="container container-sm">
            <i class="fas fa-quote-left quote-icon"></i>
            <h2 class="section-heading">In Pursuit of Excellence</h2>
            <p class="lead-text">Inspired by the life and values of Late Mr. Jalil Ahmad Ansari, whose vision,
                integrity, and dedication to craftsmanship shaped the foundation of Tajmahal Products.</p>
            <p>His principles continue to guide our pursuit of excellence, discretion, and enduring quality.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="philosophy-details section-padding">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header text-center">
                <h2 class="section-heading">Our Philosophy</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="philosophy-grid">
                <div class="philosophy-card text-center">
                    <div class="icon-wrapper"><i class="fas fa-gem"></i></div>
                    <h3>Detail</h3>
                    <p>We believe true luxury lies in detail. Every knot, thread, and dye is carefully selected and
                        placed by master artisans.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="philosophy-card text-center">
                    <div class="icon-wrapper"><i class="fas fa-balance-scale"></i></div>
                    <h3>Restraint</h3>
                    <p>Our designs embrace restraint, allowing the materials and craftsmanship to speak louder than
                        ostentation.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="philosophy-card text-center">
                    <div class="icon-wrapper"><i class="fas fa-hourglass-half"></i></div>
                    <h3>Longevity</h3>
                    <p>A Tajmahal carpet is built to last generations, aging beautifully and becoming a treasured
                        heirloom.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>